  "job_B9.9.1_20251003_115122": {
    "chunk_text": "Sum mann s\u00e6ig\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t synne nis nan \u00feing, & gyf \u00fe\u00e6t so\u00f0 is, \u00feonne is hit wunder, \u00fe\u00e6t God fordem\u00f0 \u00fea Of Gode synden ealle \u00feing, & ealle he geworhte heo gode, & for \u00fean we understande\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t synne nis nan Hwa is wyrhte \u00fe\u00e6re synne? Mann is wyrhte \u00feere synne, & deofol tyhtere. Is hit hefigteme \u00feing \u00fe\u00e6t man synegige? An lytel synne, \u00feone man heo h\u00e6f\u00f0 gedon, beo his gewittscipe, heo is mare \u00feone eall middeneard, & Hwu? Nis manslege & forleger yfel? Sume si\u00f0e by\u00f0 manslege god, swa hit w\u00e6s \u00fea \u00fea Dauid sloh Goliam, & Judith Holofernem. Ac \u00feonne by\u00f0 mansl\u00e6ge yfel, \u00feonne man hine de\u00f0 beo his agene gewille unscellice, & forleger is on Sy\u00f0\u00f0en God geworhte \u00fea gode & \u00fea yfele, & hit is gewriten \u00fe\u00e6t God ne hate\u00f0 nan \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feingen \u00fee he God lufe\u00f0 ealle \u00fea \u00feing \u00fee he geworhte, ac he ne gebring\u00f0 heo na ealla on anre wununga. Swa swa se litigere \u00fee lufe\u00f0 \u00e6lces heowes lit, ac naht ealla gelice, & \u00e6lc lit he f\u00e6stne\u00f0 on swylcen Hw\u00e6t is agen cyre? Hw\u00e6t is frigdom to geceosan god o\u00f0\u00f0e yfel? \u00deone frigdom h\u00e6fde mann on neorxenewange, ac nu is se fridom ge\u00f0eowtod, for se mann ne cann nan Ne \u00feaget ne m\u00e6ig he hit gefor\u00f0igen, bute God him fylste \u00fe\u00e6rto. Hw\u00e6t is beo \u00fean mannen \u00fee forwurpe",
